WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.420
A Paralympian, Christine Gauthier, testified before Parliament.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.261
She called Veterans Affairs about a wheelchair ramp.

00:00:07.261 --> 00:00:08.943
They offered her death instead.

00:00:08.943 --> 00:00:10.397
A wheelchair ramp.

00:00:10.397 --> 00:00:13.863
And the government's answer was: have you considered being killed?

00:00:13.863 --> 00:00:15.193
Five veterans.

00:00:15.193 --> 00:00:16.113
On the record.

00:00:16.113 --> 00:00:17.170
Under oath.
